Date: [meeting date if mentioned, else today]
Meeting: [title or topic if identifiable]
Attendees: [if mentioned]

━━━ DECISIONS MADE ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
1. [Decision — one clear sentence]
2. [Decision]
[If none: No firm decisions were made in this meeting.]

━━━ ACTION ITEMS ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
| # | Action | Owner | Due |
|---|--------|-------|-----|
| 1 | [What] | [Who] | [When / No deadline set] |
| 2 | [...] | [...] | [...] |

━━━ OPEN QUESTIONS ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
• [Question that needs resolution before next meeting]
• [Question]
[If none: All discussion points were resolved.]

